---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy | Cottonwood Community Library" description="What this website collects, why, and the choices you have.">
  <PageIntro title="Privacy" width="prose" />
  <section class="container-prose section pt-0" aria-label="Privacy details">
    <div class="prose-flow">
      <p>We keep this short and plain. The Cottonwood Community Library collects as little as it can and never sells anything about you.</p>
      <h2>Visit statistics (only if you allow them)</h2>
      <p>If you choose "Allow statistics," Google Analytics uses cookies to count the pages you visit and a few clicks, such as the catalog and Donate buttons. It helps us see which parts of the website people use. Advertising features are off, and we don't send names, email addresses, what you type into forms, or search terms.</p>
      <p>If you allowed statistics and then give through Givebutter on this website, Givebutter also tells our Google Analytics when a gift is started and completed, with the amount and the fundraiser's name. It does not send your name, email address or card details.</p>
      <p>If you choose "No thanks," Google Analytics never loads. You can change your mind any time with "Privacy choices" at the bottom of every page; turning statistics off also removes this website's Analytics cookies. Google handles this information under its <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
      <h2>Donations</h2>
      <p>Donations go through Givebutter, the library's fundraising service. Donate buttons load Givebutter's checkout on this website, so your browser connects to Givebutter, and your gift and the details you enter are handled under Givebutter's <a class="underline" href="https://givebutter.com/privacy">privacy policy</a>. The library sees your gift in Givebutter so we can thank you and keep records.</p>
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <p>When you sign up, your email address (and first name, if you give one) goes through this website to the library's mailing list in Givebutter. The website doesn't keep a copy, and it isn't sent to Google Analytics. Every newsletter has an unsubscribe link. To stop spam, the form may use Cloudflare Turnstile, which checks that a person is filling it in; Cloudflare handles that check under its <a class="underline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
      <h2>Map</h2>
      <p>The map uses OpenStreetMap data from OpenFreeMap. Loading it makes normal web requests to the map provider. It never asks for your location.</p>
      <h2>Other services</h2>
      <p>The library catalog, Givebutter and our social media pages are separate services with their own privacy policies.</p>
      <p>Questions? Call or email the library; the details are at the bottom of every page.</p>
      <p class="text-muted">Last updated October 27, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
